{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10535","headline":"秋日作 · 高适","name":"秋日作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"端居值秋节，此日更愁辛。\n寂寞无一事，蒿莱通四邻。\n闭门生白发，回首忆青春。\n岁月不相待，交游随衆人。\n云霄何处托，愚直有谁亲。\n举酒聊自劝，穷通信尔身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10535.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10535","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}